begincodeV2
name:按钮点击'补偿
params:String uid,String name
lines:
Canvas ui=fun create.canvas(Canvas canvas@1@@3@3)
UIRect panel=varf Canvas.ui.readUIRect(String panel)
UIInput nameInput=varf Canvas.ui.readUIInput(String panel/nameInput)
varf UIInput.nameInput.setText(var name)
UIInput uidInput=varf Canvas.ui.readUIInput(String panel/uidInput)
varf UIInput.uidInput.setText(var uid)
UIButton b=varf Canvas.ui.readUIButton(String panel/okButton)
varf UIButton.b.clickCB1(String 按钮点击'补偿玩家:var ui)
varf UIButton.b.clickCB1(String 按钮点击'关闭UI:var panel)
UIButton b=varf Canvas.ui.readUIButton(String panel/cancel)
varf UIButton.b.clickCB1(String 按钮点击'关闭UI:var panel)
endcode